  "text": "You start your morning yoga in a cozy grey turtleneck sweater, which feels perfect for gentle stretches and breathwork. After the session, you slip into the same top with wide-leg grey jeans—relaxed but polished enough for coffee with friends later. The khaki bomber jacket wraps around you like a soft shield, easy to take off when it gets warm or layer on if needed. Your dark brown suede flats keep your feet comfortable through all the movement, while the bright red crocodile-pattern bag adds a playful pop of color to your quiet day.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Leave the bomber jacket off at yoga class for ease of movement—pull it back on later when you meet up for coffee",
    "Tuck the sweater hem slightly into the jeans at the front to highlight your waist, keeping the relaxed fit in mind"
  ],
